2. **P1: Final safety validation still has a post-commit race.**  
The final delivery transaction verifies opt-out, takeover, complaints, staff activity, prompt versions, and lifecycle state, then commits. `sendWhatsAppText()` runs afterward. Any stop condition occurring between commit and provider submission will not prevent delivery.  
