3. **P1: Customer opt-out is not persisted authoritatively.**  
The validator and final gate scan only the latest 50 customer messages using regex. There is no durable contact-restriction record in the schema. An older opt-out can eventually disappear from the safety window. Opt-out must remain active until an explicit opt-in changes it.  
