4. **P1: Premium AI generation is checked against one quota counter but recorded against another.**  
`assertCanUseAiReplies()` checks `aiRepliesUsed`. Premium generation then calls `trackRequest()`, which only increments `aiRequestsUsed`. Therefore these provider calls do not consume the counter used to enforce the limit. Regeneration can make two unbounded paid requests.  
