6. **P2: `RECALCULATE` cancels the job without creating durable recalculation work.**  
The execution changes the job to `CANCELLED` and the execution to `RECALCULATION_REQUIRED`, but no worker processes that status. Prompt, rule, appointment, or assignment changes can therefore terminate the sequence instead of recalculating it.  
