7. **P2: Natural-language timing is initially interpreted in UTC.**  
“Tonight,” “tomorrow,” and “next Monday” are calculated with UTC setters. Business-hours validation can adjust invalid times, but it cannot reliably recover the customer’s intended local meaning.  
