8. **P2: Premium continuation businesses can be starved by ordinary scheduled jobs.**  
Business IDs are concatenated with scheduled jobs first and then sliced to the global limit. Under sustained load, businesses appearing only in the Premium continuation result can repeatedly be excluded.  
